<LanguageData>
  <!-- Provisioner Aura -->
  <!--原中文: '补给光环', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Provisioner',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Provisioner-->
  <TM_ProvisionerAura.label>补给光环</TM_ProvisionerAura.label>
  <!--原中文: '切换至供给者光环:提高休息值，减少附近殖民者的饥饿感。可以改善和修复设备，提高自然愈合率，并促进能量再生。这个光环需要60点体力来维持。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Use ability to toggle the Provisioner Aura: improves rest and reduces hunger of nearby pawns. Can be improved to repair equipment, increase natural healing rates, and boost energy regeneration. This aura requires 60 stamina to maintain.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Use ability to toggle the Provisioner Aura: improves rest and reduces hunger of nearby pawns. Can be improved to repair equipment, increase natural healing rates, and boost energy regeneration. This aura requires 60 stamina to maintain.-->
  <TM_ProvisionerAura.description>切换至供给者光环:提高休息值，减少附近殖民者的饥饿感。可以改善和修复设备，提高自然愈合率，并促进能量再生。这个光环需要60点体力来维持。</TM_ProvisionerAura.description>
  <!-- Task Master Aura -->
  <!--原中文: '任务大师', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Task Master',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Task Master-->
  <TM_TaskMasterAura.label>任务大师</TM_TaskMasterAura.label>
  <!--原中文: '切换至任务大师光环:增加工作速度、进食速度和携带能力，但会降低殖民者的社交能力。在一个有任务大师光环的殖民者监督下的殖民者将获得一个情绪惩罚。这个光环需要70点体力来维持。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Use ability to toggle the Task Master Aura: increases work speed, eating speed, and carrying capacity but causes pawns to be less social. Pawns under the scrutiny of a Task Master will acquire a mood penalty. This aura requires 70 stamina to maintain.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Use ability to toggle the Task Master Aura: increases work speed, eating speed, and carrying capacity but causes pawns to be less social. Pawns under the scrutiny of a Task Master will acquire a mood penalty. This aura requires 70 stamina to maintain.-->
  <TM_TaskMasterAura.description>切换至任务大师光环:增加工作速度、进食速度和携带能力，但会降低殖民者的社交能力。在一个有任务大师光环的殖民者监督下的殖民者将获得一个情绪惩罚。这个光环需要70点体力来维持。</TM_TaskMasterAura.description>
  <!-- Commander Aura -->
  <!--原中文: '指挥官光环', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Commander',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Commander-->
  <TM_CommanderAura.label>指挥官光环</TM_CommanderAura.label>
  <!--原中文: '切换至指挥官光环:改善附近所有殖民者的情绪，但降低他们的效率。当这个光环被激活的时候，指挥官会找出那些因为精神压力而崩溃的殖民者，并给他们一个激励演讲来克服崩溃。用这种方式来克服精神上的崩溃的殖民者将不会得到净化。这个光环需要80点体力才能维持。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Use ability to toggle the Commander Aura: improves the mood of all nearby pawns but decreases their productivity. While this aura is enabled, the Commander will seek out pawns that have broken down due to mental stress and give them a motivational speech to overcome a breakdown. Pawns that overcome a mental break in this manner will not gain Catharsis. This aura requires 80 stamina to maintain.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Use ability to toggle the Commander Aura: improves the mood of all nearby pawns but decreases their productivity. While this aura is enabled, the Commander will seek out pawns that have broken down due to mental stress and give them a motivational speech to overcome a breakdown. Pawns that overcome a mental break in this manner will not gain Catharsis. This aura requires 80 stamina to maintain.-->
  <TM_CommanderAura.description>切换至指挥官光环:改善附近所有殖民者的情绪，但降低他们的效率。当这个光环被激活的时候，指挥官会找出那些因为精神压力而崩溃的殖民者，并给他们一个激励演讲来克服崩溃。用这种方式来克服精神上的崩溃的殖民者将不会得到净化。这个光环需要80点体力才能维持。</TM_CommanderAura.description>
  <!-- Stay Alert -->
  <!--原中文: '保持警惕!', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Stay Alert!',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: Stay Alert!-->
  <TM_StayAlert.label>保持警惕!</TM_StayAlert.label>
  <!--原中文: '发出命令，让附近所有的殖民者保持高度警惕。受影响的殖民者将立即得到休息值的增加和增强视力。\n冷却时间:120秒\n最大的目标数量:10\n范围:14\n当指挥官的社交技能低于10时，殖民者可以拒绝命令;5的社会技能将有50%的机会被范围内的每个殖民者拒绝。\n命令会导致情绪障碍;每个命令都增加了情绪障碍的严重性。\n命令不影响指挥官。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'Issues the command for all nearby pawns to stay on high alert. Affected pawns will instantly gain rest and have increased sight. 

Cooldown: 120s
Max Targets: 10
Range: 14

Pawns may reject commands if the commander's social skill is below 10; a social skill of 5 would have a 50% chance to be rejected by each pawn in range.
Commands cause a mood debuff; each command increases the severity of the debuff.
Commands do not affect the commander.',更新于2026-02-14-->
